{"page":128,"width":1904,"height":2650,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"미로 문제를 위하여 하나의 스택을 가정히자. 생쥐는 현재 위치에서 이동이 기능한 킨들의 위","words":[{"text":"미로","x":450,"y":214,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"문제를","x":524,"y":215,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"위하여","x":633,"y":216,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"하나의","x":738,"y":216,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"스택을","x":843,"y":216,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"가정히자.","x":950,"y":215,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"생쥐는","x":1098,"y":216,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"현재","x":1206,"y":217,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"위치에서","x":1283,"y":217,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"이동이","x":1426,"y":216,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"기능한","x":1537,"y":216,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"킨들의","x":1649,"y":216,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"위","x":1760,"y":218,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"치를 위, 아래. 왼쪽. 오른쪽의 순서로 스택에 저장하고 스택에서 및까위의 위치를 끼니며 현재의","words":[{"text":"치를","x":414,"y":275,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"위,","x":490,"y":274,"width":37,"height":37},{"text":"아래.","x":546,"y":274,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"왼쪽.","x":634,"y":275,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"오른쪽의","x":720,"y":274,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"순서로","x":858,"y":274,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"스택에","x":964,"y":274,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"저장하고","x":1073,"y":274,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"스택에서","x":1213,"y":275,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"및까위의","x":1356,"y":274,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"위치를","x":1468,"y":275,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"끼니며","x":1581,"y":274,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"현재의","x":1694,"y":274,"width":92,"height":39}]},{"text":"위치로 한 다음에. 같은 작업을 반복한다. 이러한 반혁은 현재의 의치가 출구와 같기나 모든 위","words":[{"text":"위치로","x":412,"y":335,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":520,"y":334,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"다음에.","x":566,"y":333,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"같은","x":684,"y":334,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"작업을","x":758,"y":333,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"반복한다.","x":866,"y